      "created_at": "2011-11-01T14:34:15.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I wanted to let you all know that we put a signed copy of Sentinels of the Multiverse, along with the Young Legacy promo card, up on the Jack Vasel Memorial Fund Auction.  <a href=\"http://www.boardgamegeek.com/geeklist/74068/item/1893272#item1893272\" data-bbcode=\"true\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">Here’s a link.</a></p>\n<p>I also want to urge you to check out the other things on the auction.  It’s really a big deal, and the positive things that can come out of this are entirely worthwhile.  Even if you don’t see anything on the auction you want (I know you already have Sentinels of the Multiverse, for instance) you might pass this on to anyone who might be interested.  <a href=\"http://jackvasel.org/about/index.html\" data-bbcode=\"true\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">Here’s more information on the Jack Vasel Memorial Fund.</a></p>\n<p>Thank you all for being such a great community.  I say it a lot out loud, but rarely here - you all are awesome.</p>",
